# With the option "victory fanfare" on (as in the original), an enemy
# falling while the weapon is out brings the fanfare, then the fight music
do: option:album_music,off;option:victory_fanfare,on;vitals:5000;t250;goto:15000,5600,8;t5;spawn:357,-200;t5;combat;t5;slay:62;t10
expect: music 109 then 98
